WEBVTT

00:14.830 --> 00:17.780
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.960 --> 00:21.620
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:21.620 --> 00:27.020
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:28.500 --> 00:32.049
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:32.590 --> 00:36.880
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.840 --> 00:41.390
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:42.380 --> 00:44.590
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:44.590 --> 00:47.630
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:47.630 --> 00:49.710
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:49.710 --> 00:53.780
♪I have no regrets♪

00:54.290 --> 00:59.060
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:59.060 --> 01:03.340
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:03.340 --> 01:04.750
♪Over the time♪

01:04.750 --> 01:06.770
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.770 --> 01:09.620
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:09.620 --> 01:12.880
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.880 --> 01:17.580
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:18.289 --> 01:25.940
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:38.610 --> 01:43.970
=Sword and Fairy=

01:45.780 --> 01:50.090
Legend has it that Lord Ming
is the ancient behemoth Kun.

01:50.490 --> 01:54.130
It roams the world above the clouds

01:54.450 --> 01:57.370
(Tea houses and restaurants)
and has the power to destroy the world.

01:58.070 --> 02:01.580
The human cult Qiyuan Sect
reveres Lord Ming

02:01.670 --> 02:03.230
and brings calamity to humanity.

02:03.470 --> 02:05.750
The major sects led by the Luo Mansion

02:05.750 --> 02:07.790
search everywhere for Lord Ming,

02:07.790 --> 02:09.430
wishing to vanquish it.

02:10.190 --> 02:12.750
Lord Ming, having absorbed
a vast amount of dark energy,

02:12.750 --> 02:14.150
is about to lose control.

02:14.990 --> 02:18.470
Many civilians who believe in
the Qiyuan Sect are petrified.

02:19.710 --> 02:21.829
A great catastrophe
is imminent upon the world.

02:25.829 --> 02:28.610
(Yujie Hub, guardians of the Six Realms,
territory of the Hengdao Sect)

02:29.510 --> 02:30.310
It's about time.

02:31.590 --> 02:32.230
Huan,

02:32.790 --> 02:34.230
seal away Qi's memories

02:34.750 --> 02:36.110
and send her to the Mortal Realm.

02:39.590 --> 02:42.310
The hope of saving all beings
in the future

02:43.070 --> 02:44.510
is now entrusted to her.

03:45.950 --> 03:47.550
Master, I know it's you.

03:51.310 --> 03:52.829
Master, stop hiding.

03:52.829 --> 03:53.710
Come out.

04:03.030 --> 04:03.950
Has Commander Ying

04:03.950 --> 04:05.270
agreed to take us to the human world?

04:10.950 --> 04:12.470
Master, what's wrong with you?

04:12.950 --> 04:14.110
You're acting so strange today.

04:18.589 --> 04:19.029
Qi,

04:20.230 --> 04:21.550
your sword originates from thoughts.

04:22.029 --> 04:23.470
Do you know your mission
behind that sword?

04:26.750 --> 04:28.430
My mission behind the sword?

04:29.150 --> 04:31.350
Does carrying a sword
mean I must kill people?

04:32.750 --> 04:34.190
But I don't want to kill anyone.

04:39.390 --> 04:41.230
Master, what do you want to do?

04:50.070 --> 04:53.030
Master, what are you going to do?

04:58.530 --> 05:03.140
=Episode 1=

05:04.670 --> 05:06.390
Master, I know it's you.

05:07.470 --> 05:08.910
Master, stop hiding.

05:09.030 --> 05:09.790
Come out.

05:10.710 --> 05:11.350
Qi.

05:13.110 --> 05:13.630
Qi.

05:14.670 --> 05:15.190
Qi.

05:16.230 --> 05:18.590
Qi, wake up.

05:24.910 --> 05:25.310
Awake?

05:28.870 --> 05:29.470
Yue...

05:30.230 --> 05:31.230
Jin...

05:33.270 --> 05:35.750
zhao!

05:37.030 --> 05:37.750
What?

05:37.950 --> 05:38.790
Why did you pinch me?

05:39.330 --> 05:40.570
(Yue Qi)

05:40.950 --> 05:42.350
I dreamt of my master again.

05:42.630 --> 05:43.870
If you had not suddenly interrupted,

05:44.190 --> 05:45.990
I would have seen clearly
what he looked like.

05:46.390 --> 05:48.150
Enough. You say this every time.

05:48.150 --> 05:49.750
If you could,
you'd have seen him clearly.

05:49.950 --> 05:51.990
I guess your master
doesn't exist at all.

05:52.870 --> 05:54.630
How can you say that?

05:55.030 --> 05:56.230
If he doesn't exist,

05:56.350 --> 05:58.190
where did I learn those moves from?

06:01.750 --> 06:02.430
Yue Qi,

06:03.550 --> 06:05.630
I took care of you
with great hardship for three years,

06:06.170 --> 06:07.370
(Yue Jinzhao)
but I can't hold a candle

06:07.370 --> 06:08.950
(Yue Jinzhao)
to your faceless master.

06:16.310 --> 06:17.030
Be gentle.

06:17.350 --> 06:18.230
Don't use violence.

06:19.990 --> 06:21.270
I'll use violence.

06:22.030 --> 06:22.750
I will.

06:23.430 --> 06:24.590
I'll hit you.

06:25.230 --> 06:26.470
I am your elder brother.

06:29.830 --> 06:31.110
Who says you're older than me?

06:31.350 --> 06:33.790
3 years ago, when we woke up
in Wuyan Village,

06:33.790 --> 06:34.430
both of us

06:34.430 --> 06:36.270
didn't remember what happened before.

06:36.310 --> 06:37.790
And it was you who said

06:37.790 --> 06:39.590
that our birthdays were on the same day.

06:42.110 --> 06:43.270
You don't understand

06:43.270 --> 06:44.390
anything else

06:44.390 --> 06:46.150
but you remember this clearly.

06:47.990 --> 06:48.430
Well,

06:48.430 --> 06:50.830
today is the 14th day
of the 7th month, our birthday.

06:51.470 --> 06:52.909
So, what should we eat?

06:53.390 --> 06:54.030
Egg noodles.

06:54.550 --> 06:54.870
Let's go.

06:57.630 --> 06:58.630
Here, enjoy your meal.

07:02.990 --> 07:03.990
A bowl of egg noodles, please.

07:04.030 --> 07:05.110
Without green onions.

07:05.350 --> 07:05.830
Okay!

07:09.750 --> 07:12.030
Qi, your hair rope is so worn out.

07:12.470 --> 07:13.190
Let's replace it.

07:13.670 --> 07:14.430
I can't throw it.

07:14.990 --> 07:16.670
I was wearing it when I woke up.

07:16.910 --> 07:18.870
It might be related to my background.

07:19.150 --> 07:20.870
Maybe it was really given by my master.

07:21.270 --> 07:23.070
I really do hope you have a master.

07:23.190 --> 07:25.070
That way, we would have
a clue about our origins.

07:25.470 --> 07:26.750
I really did dream of him.

07:28.150 --> 07:30.110
It's just that, in my dream,

07:30.790 --> 07:32.110
I couldn't see his face.

07:32.750 --> 07:34.590
Nor could I remember what he said.

07:36.030 --> 07:37.230
But,

07:37.750 --> 07:39.070
I was thinking,

07:39.590 --> 07:40.670
- thinking...
- Your noodles.

07:40.670 --> 07:41.270
Thinking what?

07:44.630 --> 07:45.030
Enjoy.

07:45.909 --> 07:47.110
I must be hungry.

07:47.990 --> 07:48.870
What for?

07:51.470 --> 07:54.190
Jinzhao, you said
you were older than me.

07:54.430 --> 07:55.750
Show me some love.

07:56.710 --> 07:57.670
The same old rules.

07:57.670 --> 07:58.790
Whoever grabs it eats it.

08:38.549 --> 08:39.830
You said it.

08:39.950 --> 08:41.710
Whoever grabs it first eats it.

08:42.030 --> 08:43.070
You eat it.

08:46.230 --> 08:47.070
Why aren't you eating?

08:49.110 --> 08:51.470
Jinzhao, are you serious?

08:51.470 --> 08:54.630
Do you have to use Mindlink
to snatch an egg?

09:16.260 --> 09:17.030
(Sichuan Pepper Powder)

09:19.630 --> 09:21.230
You're cheating.
You've learned to be bad.

09:21.630 --> 09:23.310
I learned that from you.

09:26.430 --> 09:27.870
This bowl of noodles is mine now.

09:34.830 --> 09:36.230
Why do you love egg noodles so much?

09:39.310 --> 09:41.190
Because it is the first food

09:41.230 --> 09:42.310
you made for me.

09:46.390 --> 09:46.870
Qi,

09:48.590 --> 09:49.430
eat slower.

09:50.230 --> 09:51.150
Leave some soup for me.

09:58.550 --> 09:58.950
Come on.

10:03.070 --> 10:03.950
I drew this last night.

10:04.470 --> 10:05.950
This is the person I saw
with my left eye.

10:07.270 --> 10:08.830
What a scratch.

10:08.830 --> 10:09.390
What?

10:09.510 --> 10:11.110
Scratch?

10:11.350 --> 10:13.150
This captures both
the person's looks and vibe, okay?

10:15.110 --> 10:16.230
It can ward off evil.

10:19.950 --> 10:20.710
Stop kidding around.

10:21.590 --> 10:22.550
Compared to your dream,

10:22.750 --> 10:24.190
my left eye is more reliable.

10:24.510 --> 10:25.910
Every time the trail goes cold,

10:26.190 --> 10:26.830
my left eye

10:26.830 --> 10:28.790
always manages to foresee something,

10:29.230 --> 10:29.790
although...

10:29.790 --> 10:33.750
Although the price of seeing the future
is intense pain in your left eye.

10:33.950 --> 10:36.910
I could recite these words
of yours by heart by now.

10:37.190 --> 10:38.350
Why do you care?

10:39.430 --> 10:41.030
Anyway, this time in Yinghui Fort,

10:41.270 --> 10:42.590
we have to find this man in red.

10:42.590 --> 10:43.310
No matter what,

10:44.350 --> 10:45.190
we must find him.

10:46.470 --> 10:48.710
(Yinghui Fort)

11:08.150 --> 11:08.790
Jinzhao,

11:09.470 --> 11:11.750
you haven't given me
this year's birthday present yet.

11:15.190 --> 11:16.350
It's all yours.

11:17.350 --> 11:18.950
Why are you so generous today?

11:26.510 --> 11:27.430
Yue Jinzhao,

11:27.430 --> 11:28.350
you don't want

11:28.350 --> 11:29.750
to give me a birthday present, right?

11:30.310 --> 11:32.110
No, I'm out of money.

11:32.310 --> 11:33.990
If we keep going like this,
we will go bankrupt.

11:34.710 --> 11:35.230
You see.

11:35.350 --> 11:36.190
Hotel costs aside,

11:36.510 --> 11:38.310
last night we had
two large bowls of beef noodles.

11:38.310 --> 11:39.230
That was eight coins.

11:39.710 --> 11:40.710
You are a glutton,

11:40.830 --> 11:42.070
and we spent another five coins.

11:42.670 --> 11:44.870
Lastly, you took a chestnut cake.

11:44.990 --> 11:45.950
Most importantly,

11:46.150 --> 11:48.590
you were still hungry and ate
another two bowls of egg noodles.

11:49.110 --> 11:50.470
We're out of money.

11:53.070 --> 11:53.590
So,

11:53.670 --> 11:55.270
we must first find this person.

11:55.470 --> 11:56.110
I've calculated it.

11:56.670 --> 11:57.630
With our pace,

11:57.830 --> 11:58.750
within one hour,

11:58.750 --> 12:00.310
we can run through
the entire Yinghui Fort.

12:02.310 --> 12:04.110
Although it's a foolish method.

12:05.350 --> 12:06.510
Then you come up with a smart way.

12:08.550 --> 12:08.990
Let's go.

12:11.790 --> 12:12.590
Start from this point

12:12.710 --> 12:13.830
and meet here in one hour.

12:14.750 --> 12:15.790
Got it. You're unlovable.

12:20.110 --> 12:21.790
Have a look.

12:21.790 --> 12:23.510
Top-notch jewelry.

12:23.910 --> 12:24.350
Lady.

12:24.350 --> 12:24.990
Sir,

12:26.030 --> 12:27.190
how much is this?

12:28.190 --> 12:28.630
10 coins.

12:29.510 --> 12:30.510
10 coins?

12:31.430 --> 12:33.110
More expensive
than two bowls of beef noodles.

12:45.550 --> 12:48.150
That annoying guy didn't give me money.

12:49.990 --> 12:51.170
(Recruiting mourners, providing
three meals, 10 coins per day)

12:53.750 --> 12:55.590
Recruiting mourners,

12:56.110 --> 12:56.990
providing three meals,

12:57.590 --> 12:58.750
10 coins a day.

13:02.310 --> 13:03.150
I want to make money.

13:03.710 --> 13:04.310
Alright.

13:04.430 --> 13:05.430
Just try crying.

13:05.910 --> 13:06.350
Okay.

13:13.390 --> 13:14.510
I can't cry.

13:14.710 --> 13:15.430
How do I cry?

13:15.830 --> 13:17.390
Just cry like you did when your family

13:17.630 --> 13:18.230
died.

13:18.310 --> 13:19.150
I don't have a family.

13:19.710 --> 13:20.590
You don't have a family.

13:20.590 --> 13:21.390
Isn't that very pitiful?

13:21.750 --> 13:22.590
But I've got Jinzhao.

13:22.630 --> 13:23.190
Not pitiful at all.

13:23.190 --> 13:23.310
Not pitiful at all.

13:23.630 --> 13:25.670
By the way, after a person dies,

13:25.670 --> 13:26.950
they enter the cycle of reincarnation,

13:26.950 --> 13:28.030
which means starting over again.

13:28.110 --> 13:28.990
Why should I cry?

13:30.910 --> 13:33.030
This girl doesn't seem
like a normal person.

13:33.630 --> 13:35.630
Walk away, lady.

13:38.030 --> 13:39.150
Oh, no! The horse is spooked!

13:39.150 --> 13:39.990
Oh, no! The horse is spooked!

14:01.550 --> 14:02.190
Are you alright?

14:04.750 --> 14:05.590
Child, are you okay?

14:06.490 --> 14:07.590
(Luo Zhaoyan, the head of the Luo family)
Thank you very much.

14:07.590 --> 14:08.830
Thank her.

14:08.830 --> 14:09.990
Master, are you okay?

14:10.550 --> 14:12.030
Go check if there are any casualties

14:12.390 --> 14:13.630
and check the damage to the shops.

14:13.910 --> 14:14.390
Yes.

14:22.950 --> 14:23.510
Sorry, lady.

14:23.950 --> 14:25.190
That horse belongs to my family.

14:25.510 --> 14:26.550
It got startled just now.

14:26.870 --> 14:28.350
Thank you for your help.

14:29.430 --> 14:30.150
Red clothes.

14:31.670 --> 14:32.750
High ponytail.

14:37.430 --> 14:37.950
Lady?

14:47.390 --> 14:50.350
But you are much prettier
than the picture.

14:55.470 --> 14:56.550
This is a thank-you gift.

14:56.710 --> 14:57.350
Please accept it.

14:59.230 --> 15:00.070
Thank you, sir.

15:00.270 --> 15:01.510
You are so generous,

15:01.510 --> 15:03.590
but ten coins will be enough for me.

15:06.110 --> 15:07.110
This is what you deserve

15:07.350 --> 15:08.230
for your kindness.

15:08.550 --> 15:10.270
I gotta go. Goodbye.

15:20.630 --> 15:21.630
There are no white ones left.

15:21.630 --> 15:22.950
This green one is okay, right?

15:22.950 --> 15:25.590
O great Lord Ming,
blessings upon all beings.

15:25.590 --> 15:27.830
Our sect serves Lord Ming

15:27.830 --> 15:29.190
and makes people happy.

15:29.190 --> 15:31.470
Anyone who asks shall receive.

15:31.470 --> 15:32.390
Don't you agree?

15:32.390 --> 15:33.590
(Exquisite Fans)
Anyone shall receive?

15:33.950 --> 15:35.590
- We tell the masses...
- Let me go take a look.

15:35.830 --> 15:37.710
(Can they help me and Jinzhao)

15:37.870 --> 15:39.750
(find our origins?)

15:39.950 --> 15:43.670
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

15:43.670 --> 15:46.310
Mr. Meng, why aren't the two persons
Lord Shengxuan invited

15:46.550 --> 15:47.430
here yet?

15:47.910 --> 15:48.750
What's the rush?

15:53.790 --> 15:57.110
The faith in Lord Ming is very strong.

15:57.390 --> 15:59.070
He is now traveling the world

15:59.310 --> 16:01.870
and blessing us all from afar.

16:02.150 --> 16:05.310
We should even pay
more homage to Lord Ming.

16:05.670 --> 16:07.230
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

16:07.430 --> 16:08.790
Hasn't one just arrived?

16:09.750 --> 16:11.350
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

16:11.510 --> 16:13.430
You appear to be unfamiliar.

16:14.070 --> 16:16.110
Is it your first time
hearing about our sect?

16:16.590 --> 16:17.470
Who are you?

16:17.740 --> 16:18.830
(Meng Cheng, an emissary of the Qiyuan Sect)
I am Meng Cheng.

16:19.030 --> 16:20.830
I am an emissary of the Qiyuan Sect.

16:22.950 --> 16:23.910
I have forgotten my past.

16:24.070 --> 16:25.270
Can you tell me about it?

16:26.550 --> 16:28.910
That's a piece of cake.

16:30.150 --> 16:31.190
To tell you the truth,

16:31.390 --> 16:33.630
I am proficient in magic spells.

16:34.070 --> 16:35.030
Magic spells?

16:36.470 --> 16:38.470
Can you tell me about my origins?

16:40.350 --> 16:40.750
Please wait.

16:51.710 --> 16:53.190
We agreed to meet here.

16:53.990 --> 16:55.310
Where did Qi go?

17:01.710 --> 17:03.030
Qi is over there.

17:09.990 --> 17:10.510
I see it.

17:11.710 --> 17:13.349
You must come from
a rich or noble family,

17:13.550 --> 17:15.710
and you sneaked out to have fun
without your family's knowledge.

17:19.950 --> 17:20.950
You are wrong.

17:21.390 --> 17:22.790
If I were of wealth or nobility,

17:23.069 --> 17:24.470
why haven't my family
come looking for me?

17:25.349 --> 17:26.310
Well,

17:27.470 --> 17:29.190
haven't you forgotten
all about your past?

17:29.310 --> 17:30.590
How do you know I'm wrong then?

17:30.990 --> 17:31.550
Moreover,

17:31.790 --> 17:33.830
our Lord Ming is omniscient

17:33.830 --> 17:35.430
toward all matters in the world.

17:35.590 --> 17:37.030
He certainly cannot be wrong.

17:40.750 --> 17:43.110
Then tell me, where is my family now?

17:44.630 --> 17:46.790
Lady, your faith is insufficient.

17:47.150 --> 17:48.750
I can't divine any further for you.

17:50.310 --> 17:51.590
You simply don't know.

17:52.230 --> 17:52.870
Not so.

17:53.550 --> 17:56.350
Insufficient faith means
that your merit is still not much.

17:56.950 --> 17:57.870
But today,

17:58.590 --> 18:00.710
if you offer a small amount
of gold and silver to Lord Ming,

18:00.710 --> 18:02.590
you can increase
your connection with him.

18:02.990 --> 18:04.630
Then I will be able to divine for you.

18:07.550 --> 18:07.870
Look,

18:08.710 --> 18:10.470
so many people are accumulating merits.

18:10.790 --> 18:11.550
You should go now,

18:12.350 --> 18:13.470
or it'll be too late.

18:19.030 --> 18:23.390
Believe the Qiyuan Sect
for Lord Ming's blessing.

18:23.390 --> 18:25.150
Pay homage to Lord Ming
to accumulate merits.

18:26.990 --> 18:28.310
Pay homage to Lord Ming.

18:30.030 --> 18:30.510
Lady,

18:30.590 --> 18:31.790
I've been investigating this sect.

18:31.830 --> 18:32.750
The so-called merits

18:32.750 --> 18:34.230
are just a means
for them to collect money.

18:34.510 --> 18:35.070
Don't trust them.

18:35.310 --> 18:36.110
Nonsense.

18:36.390 --> 18:37.430
They bring benefits to us.

18:37.630 --> 18:38.470
We make these donations

18:38.590 --> 18:39.830
voluntarily to Lord Ming.

18:40.310 --> 18:40.670
Yes.

18:40.670 --> 18:42.350
- Yes.
- We do it voluntarily.

18:42.550 --> 18:43.590
- It's voluntary.
- Voluntary.

19:00.100 --> 19:01.450
(Yunlai Inn)

19:04.010 --> 19:06.280
(Yunlai Inn)

19:08.790 --> 19:09.310
Let's set off.

19:09.590 --> 19:09.870
Go.

19:10.790 --> 19:11.470
(It's him.)

19:11.590 --> 19:13.190
(He is key to our search
for our background.)

19:13.230 --> 19:14.950
(We must find a way to gain his trust.)

19:14.950 --> 19:15.830
Your merit is respectable.

19:19.910 --> 19:22.070
This person slanders our sect
with malicious intent.

19:22.230 --> 19:22.990
Stop him!

19:22.990 --> 19:23.510
Stop him!

19:23.510 --> 19:24.190
That's right.

19:24.510 --> 19:26.750
How could the Qiyuan Sect
be slandered at will?

19:26.910 --> 19:27.710
Who is this?

19:28.030 --> 19:28.750
Jinzhao.

19:33.350 --> 19:34.030
Who might you be?

19:34.870 --> 19:36.630
I am just an ordinary man

19:36.950 --> 19:38.790
who rights wrongs, promotes goodness

19:39.310 --> 19:43.110
and is determined
to uphold the honor of the sect.

19:43.710 --> 19:44.630
Mr. Meng,

19:45.430 --> 19:47.030
isn't this another person
from the portrait?

19:47.750 --> 19:49.190
Isn't this a good thing?

19:49.580 --> 19:51.270
(Making your wishes come true,
ascend soon with eternal peace)

19:51.270 --> 19:52.430
Take it easy.

19:53.110 --> 19:55.750
This young man really speaks the truth.

19:56.830 --> 20:00.710
All thanks to Lord Ming's blessing.

20:00.870 --> 20:01.470
That's correct.

20:01.710 --> 20:03.630
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

20:03.950 --> 20:13.350
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

20:13.430 --> 20:14.750
I have come all this way in pursuit

20:14.830 --> 20:16.390
and have seen
the Qiyuan Sect harming lives.

20:16.470 --> 20:17.670
Lord Ming is the chief culprit.

20:17.950 --> 20:20.190
You apostles
are also guilty of great evil.

20:22.190 --> 20:24.030
You keep insulting the Qiyuan Sect.

20:24.350 --> 20:25.390
You are the one to blame.

20:26.830 --> 20:27.470
Mr. Meng,

20:27.830 --> 20:29.430
I will teach him a good lesson.

20:29.710 --> 20:31.430
Good. May Lord Ming bless you.

20:31.550 --> 20:33.070
He'll help you punish this hellion.

20:33.870 --> 20:35.430
Sir, why not join our sect

20:35.550 --> 20:36.470
and you may ascend?

20:36.870 --> 20:38.150
Is it a real fight, Jinzhao?

20:38.630 --> 20:39.750
Of course. Let's go.

21:03.750 --> 21:04.270
Jinzhao.

21:10.880 --> 21:13.160
(Yunlai Inn)

21:37.270 --> 21:38.030
Jinzhao.

21:38.030 --> 21:38.910
This place is dangerous.

21:39.030 --> 21:40.470
Mr. Meng, please retreat.

21:40.870 --> 21:41.710
Alright.

21:41.990 --> 21:42.630
Wait a moment.

21:43.150 --> 21:44.510
You said to let us join the sect.

21:44.630 --> 21:45.190
Is that true?

21:45.470 --> 21:47.110
I'll wait for you
at the Fujin Hall later.

21:47.110 --> 21:49.190
Good. Wait until I'm done
with this audacious man.

21:54.470 --> 21:54.950
Take this.

21:59.980 --> 22:01.320
(Tavern)

22:09.130 --> 22:11.240
(Cakes)

22:32.270 --> 22:34.590
(This girl is so strong.)

22:37.550 --> 22:38.870
Qi, stop.

22:42.950 --> 22:44.510
My apologies for offending you just now.

22:45.430 --> 22:46.070
What do you mean?

22:46.870 --> 22:47.870
The audience has left.

22:47.870 --> 22:48.710
Why keep acting?

22:51.110 --> 22:52.300
(Carriage and Horse Shop)

22:54.630 --> 22:55.430
You did it on purpose.

22:55.710 --> 22:57.310
Jinzhao is good at acting
and deceiving others.

22:58.110 --> 22:59.070
Don't you feel ashamed?

22:59.230 --> 23:00.470
How can you be so gullible?

23:00.630 --> 23:01.110
You're really naive.

23:01.310 --> 23:01.510
You're really naive.

23:01.790 --> 23:03.070
Who says I was deceived?

23:03.990 --> 23:06.230
The bag just now was filled with stones.

23:06.510 --> 23:07.790
Not a single coin in it.

23:08.190 --> 23:09.270
All the coins are here.

23:10.670 --> 23:12.870
Since when did you learn
to play tricks on people?

23:13.190 --> 23:15.310
You were the one
who tricked me with stones first.

23:19.990 --> 23:22.190
(Yunlai Inn)
Sorry. Just now, I thought

23:22.230 --> 23:23.710
you were really going
to give money to them.

23:24.150 --> 23:24.790
No, I wasn't.

23:24.790 --> 23:27.310
And I didn't expect
to inadvertently deceive them.

23:28.390 --> 23:29.390
You're truly adorable.

23:29.830 --> 23:31.310
Good taste.

23:31.310 --> 23:32.310
My name is Yue Qi.

23:32.310 --> 23:33.470
This is Yue Jinzhao.

23:36.390 --> 23:37.350
My name is Luo Zhaoyan.

23:37.910 --> 23:38.630
The Luo family head?

23:41.310 --> 23:43.310
Although we have been
at Yinghui Fort for only two days,

23:43.750 --> 23:45.110
we have heard that for centuries,

23:45.110 --> 23:46.950
your family has been protecting
the nearby residents

23:47.070 --> 23:47.630
and is much loved.

23:48.990 --> 23:50.270
I've heard a storyteller say

23:50.670 --> 23:52.830
that your family is known
as the Twilight Luo Family.

23:53.430 --> 23:55.030
Twins in your family all pass away

23:55.430 --> 23:57.150
before reaching
their twenties or thirties.

23:57.990 --> 23:58.550
I'm sorry.

23:58.950 --> 23:59.990
She's immature

24:00.070 --> 24:00.870
and has no filter.

24:01.070 --> 24:01.630
Sorry.

24:04.510 --> 24:04.910
It's okay.

24:05.590 --> 24:06.590
Everyone knows it.

24:06.950 --> 24:08.150
I've got used to such words.

24:10.430 --> 24:10.950
I'm sorry.

24:12.190 --> 24:12.550
It's okay.

24:13.510 --> 24:13.870
You two.

24:14.150 --> 24:15.910
The Qiyuan Sect schemes
for money and hurts people,

24:16.110 --> 24:17.830
but the mastermind,
Lord Ming, stays hidden.

24:17.830 --> 24:19.630
It's a real maze of secrets.

24:19.950 --> 24:21.910
I just saw her talking with Meng Cheng,

24:22.230 --> 24:23.070
worried she'd fall for it,

24:23.190 --> 24:23.990
so I took action.

24:24.470 --> 24:26.390
How dare they deceive us?

24:27.310 --> 24:28.310
Consider it their bad luck.

24:28.710 --> 24:29.790
Since our goal is the same,

24:29.790 --> 24:30.750
how about joining forces?

24:33.030 --> 24:34.310
They've been gone for a while.

24:34.430 --> 24:35.630
Come on, or we won't catch up.

24:38.150 --> 24:38.830
Let's join hands.

24:42.270 --> 24:42.670
Qi,

24:44.630 --> 24:46.110
he's the one I saw with my left eye.

24:49.070 --> 24:49.470
Watch him.

24:51.430 --> 24:53.310
Okay, I'll definitely keep
a close eye on him.

24:53.310 --> 24:53.590
Go.

25:00.870 --> 25:01.510
Miss Yue.

25:02.710 --> 25:03.110
What?

25:05.550 --> 25:07.510
Nothing.

25:09.390 --> 25:10.030
Luo,

25:10.950 --> 25:12.830
how old are you, and where is your home?

25:12.950 --> 25:13.790
How many in your family?

25:13.790 --> 25:14.670
Are you married?

25:15.550 --> 25:16.550
She doesn't mean that.

25:18.830 --> 25:19.950
That's exactly what I mean.

25:19.950 --> 25:21.110
Do you know what you're saying?

25:21.190 --> 25:23.510
Am I not asking for his information?

25:25.110 --> 25:25.630
Mr. Yue,

25:26.710 --> 25:27.470
I know

25:28.310 --> 25:30.190
Miss Yue definitely
has no interest in me.

25:30.710 --> 25:32.470
Yes, I'm interested in you.

25:33.990 --> 25:34.310
I...

25:35.590 --> 25:37.910
I-I-I am a boring man.

25:38.510 --> 25:38.950
Mr. Luo,

25:39.590 --> 25:40.670
he has entered the Fujin Hall.

25:41.430 --> 25:42.390
If we want to find out

25:42.390 --> 25:44.910
whether this is a stronghold
of the Qiyuan Sect,

25:45.270 --> 25:46.510
we have to go in.

25:48.630 --> 25:49.950
It seems you have a clever plan.

25:50.710 --> 25:52.430
I have just gained that person's trust.

25:52.990 --> 25:54.310
I plan to pretend to join them

25:54.430 --> 25:55.670
to see if he can take me inside.

25:55.830 --> 25:56.870
But before that,

25:57.030 --> 25:58.550
could you lend me some money?

26:00.230 --> 26:00.510
This.

26:05.190 --> 26:06.190
What about mine?

26:06.430 --> 26:07.190
What about hers?

26:09.790 --> 26:10.710
It's up to you two.

26:12.790 --> 26:13.550
I'll assist out here.

26:13.710 --> 26:14.750
If you two need me, call me.

26:15.150 --> 26:16.390
We will. Let's go.

26:27.470 --> 26:28.870
You almost drove
Luo Zhaoyan away just now.

26:28.870 --> 26:29.470
Do you know?

26:30.550 --> 26:32.670
But that's how it's written
in the storybooks.

26:33.070 --> 26:34.590
That's what a matchmaker asks.

26:34.750 --> 26:35.710
Are you going to marry him?

26:37.790 --> 26:41.070
Luo is dashing and awe-inspiring
with unyielding integrity.

26:41.390 --> 26:43.150
And he gave us two gold leaves.

26:43.430 --> 26:44.910
What a good choice for a husband.

26:45.150 --> 26:46.830
His name is Luo Zhaoyan.

26:47.110 --> 26:48.670
You can respectfully
address him as Master Luo

26:48.790 --> 26:50.070
or call him Mr. Luo affectionately

26:50.190 --> 26:51.710
or at least call him Zhaoyan.

26:51.870 --> 26:53.110
What does Luo mean?

26:53.230 --> 26:54.670
Because it represents his good manners.

27:01.750 --> 27:02.230
Alright.

27:02.790 --> 27:04.550
Since you don't like me
calling him that,

27:04.550 --> 27:06.030
I won't call him that anymore.

27:06.190 --> 27:07.230
Nor am I ever gonna ask again,

27:07.430 --> 27:08.510
if you don't want me to.

27:10.070 --> 27:11.030
Little flatterer.

27:17.510 --> 27:18.950
He's out. Let's go.

27:20.830 --> 27:21.430
Mr. Meng.

27:23.950 --> 27:25.430
May Lord Ming bless us.

27:26.030 --> 27:27.430
Seeing you two safe and sound

27:27.430 --> 27:28.390
puts me at ease.

27:28.790 --> 27:30.790
Did you punish that villain?

27:31.470 --> 27:33.150
Even though he got something,

27:33.270 --> 27:34.990
we still managed to drive him off.

27:36.150 --> 27:36.710
What's that?

27:36.870 --> 27:38.310
All thanks to Lord Ming's blessing.

27:38.710 --> 27:39.310
Mr. Meng,

27:39.470 --> 27:41.430
you said earlier
you would let us join your sect.

27:41.790 --> 27:42.510
Is that true?

27:42.670 --> 27:43.990
Of course it's true.

27:44.630 --> 27:46.390
You two are truly loyal to Lord Ming.

27:46.550 --> 27:48.110
You will surely receive his grace.

27:49.190 --> 27:49.990
Thank you, Mr. Meng.

27:50.230 --> 27:51.630
This is a little token
of my appreciation.

27:52.030 --> 27:53.070
Please accept it.

27:54.790 --> 27:55.710
You don't have to.

27:59.270 --> 28:01.550
Qi, you're being naughty again.

28:03.590 --> 28:04.270
Mr. Meng.

28:07.110 --> 28:08.030
Mr. Meng,

28:08.390 --> 28:10.950
we sincerely wish to join the sect.

28:12.470 --> 28:14.030
Since you know things,

28:15.070 --> 28:15.750
follow me.

28:24.580 --> 28:28.040
(Wine)

28:30.110 --> 28:30.870
Take care, sir.

28:39.630 --> 28:41.270
These flowers look so strange.

28:43.470 --> 28:45.070
Don't just sniff it.
What if it's poisonous?

28:45.670 --> 28:46.070
Let's go.

28:58.190 --> 28:58.670
Qi,

28:59.950 --> 29:02.110
look, these statues
are just like real people.

29:02.310 --> 29:03.110
Too eerie.

29:03.790 --> 29:05.790
What craftsmanship!

29:07.270 --> 29:09.990
Each of these stone statues is unique.

29:10.190 --> 29:10.830
So interesting.

29:10.830 --> 29:11.350
Don't touch it.

29:13.110 --> 29:15.750
These were the followers
who were fortunate enough to ascend.

29:17.070 --> 29:18.590
These were all real people?

29:20.750 --> 29:21.270
Mr. Meng,

29:22.190 --> 29:23.990
this is the ascension
as practiced by our sect?

29:26.590 --> 29:29.750
Not just anyone is eligible
and fortunate enough to ascend.

29:30.350 --> 29:32.310
Aside from Director Gao Xiao,

29:32.430 --> 29:33.790
even I have to put in extra effort.

29:34.630 --> 29:36.470
Director? What director?

29:37.230 --> 29:38.470
You're not aware of this, are you?

29:39.670 --> 29:41.950
Beneath our Lord Ming is Shengxuan.

29:42.630 --> 29:44.990
Shengxuan conveys the lord's command
to the sect leader.

29:45.190 --> 29:47.270
The sect leader oversees
the directors of various regions.

29:47.550 --> 29:49.270
Under the directors
are emissaries such as me.

29:49.510 --> 29:53.030
Each emissary is responsible
for leading and managing the disciples.

29:55.310 --> 29:55.910
I understand now.

29:56.150 --> 29:59.150
So the sect in the Yinghui Fort

30:00.070 --> 30:01.950
is governed by Director Gao Xiao.

30:02.390 --> 30:03.270
That's right.

30:04.910 --> 30:06.310
The laws are strict and clear.

30:06.310 --> 30:08.550
It's worthy of a large sect
with followers everywhere.

30:08.550 --> 30:10.230
Qi, we've found ourselves a big backer.

30:11.110 --> 30:12.190
The sect is amazing,

30:12.350 --> 30:13.630
and Mr. Meng is also impressive.

30:15.390 --> 30:15.750
Let's go.

30:23.190 --> 30:23.990
(I found you.)

30:24.710 --> 30:25.150
(Qi.)

30:26.220 --> 30:28.000
(Shengxuan of the Qiyuan Sect)

30:42.550 --> 30:43.710
A flying big fish.

30:45.030 --> 30:45.910
What big fish?

30:46.750 --> 30:47.790
Such lack of experience.

30:48.030 --> 30:51.070
This is the ancient divine beast
worshipped by our sect,

30:51.070 --> 30:51.670
Kun.

31:02.310 --> 31:03.910
Qi, what's wrong?

31:05.430 --> 31:08.470
Why does this feel somewhat familiar?

31:16.190 --> 31:16.910
Done.

31:17.630 --> 31:19.510
Mr. Meng, what is this for?

31:19.750 --> 31:20.750
Have we offended you?

31:22.710 --> 31:24.350
Though the two of you are quite skilled,

31:25.070 --> 31:25.990
your brains...

31:31.710 --> 31:32.510
Mr. Meng,

31:32.590 --> 31:34.990
we sincerely wish to join your sect.

31:35.230 --> 31:36.950
Why did you lock us up?

31:37.150 --> 31:37.670
Girl,

31:38.110 --> 31:40.670
you'll have to ask
Lord Shengxuan about that.

31:42.470 --> 31:43.630
Lord Shengxuan.

31:45.030 --> 31:45.550
Farewell.

31:46.510 --> 31:47.470
- Mr. Meng.
- Mr. Meng.

31:47.470 --> 31:48.150
Mr. Meng.

31:54.510 --> 31:56.350
Jinzhao, why do I feel

31:56.350 --> 31:58.310
he deliberately lured us here?

31:58.830 --> 31:59.230
Me too.

32:00.030 --> 32:00.830
But don't worry.

32:01.510 --> 32:02.630
We will get help soon.

32:12.550 --> 32:12.830
Direc...

32:20.430 --> 32:21.110
Director Gao.

32:24.750 --> 32:25.710
Director Gao.

32:26.020 --> 32:27.270
(Gao Xiao, Qiyuan Sect's director)

32:31.630 --> 32:32.750
Director Gao!

32:37.310 --> 32:38.670
You cur!

32:39.110 --> 32:40.270
Are you on fire or what?

32:42.110 --> 32:44.910
Be ruthless in deed
and calm in character.

32:45.150 --> 32:45.670
Yes.

32:45.790 --> 32:47.510
Take your time. What's the matter?

32:48.190 --> 32:50.310
Lord Shengxuan ordered me
to capture two persons.

32:50.510 --> 32:51.430
I've led them here

32:51.430 --> 32:52.550
without much effort.

32:53.270 --> 32:53.910
What?

32:55.190 --> 32:56.110
Take it slow.

32:56.110 --> 32:57.110
It's alright.

32:57.350 --> 32:58.030
My legs are numb.

32:59.110 --> 32:59.870
Say that again.

33:00.110 --> 33:01.030
What did you just say?

33:01.190 --> 33:02.710
I locked them in the passageway.

33:03.910 --> 33:05.510
Good job.

33:06.350 --> 33:07.230
I'll credit you for this.

33:07.670 --> 33:09.830
I'm going to report to Lord Shengxuan.

33:13.030 --> 33:14.030
No need.

33:14.230 --> 33:16.430
Gao Xiao, we're here.

33:22.790 --> 33:25.110
Didn't you say it was two people?

33:25.470 --> 33:26.510
But there are three.

33:28.790 --> 33:30.070
Aren't you that audacious man?

33:30.790 --> 33:31.070
You.

33:33.310 --> 33:35.670
Are the three of you
conspiring to deceive me?

33:36.350 --> 33:38.350
I feel sorry for you.

33:38.350 --> 33:38.990
Guards!

33:39.510 --> 33:40.110
Attack!

34:31.989 --> 34:33.110
I-I-I'll go call for help.

34:33.270 --> 34:34.110
I'm going to get help.

34:39.989 --> 34:40.989
You're just unlucky

34:41.830 --> 34:42.750
to meet Qi.

34:56.030 --> 34:57.630
Please spare my life!

34:58.070 --> 34:59.430
When you did those harmful misdeeds,

34:59.670 --> 35:00.670
did you ever imagine this day?

35:01.630 --> 35:02.630
Don't.

35:03.830 --> 35:05.190
Don't come.

35:14.510 --> 35:14.950
You!

35:15.190 --> 35:17.110
Y-Y-You useless thing.

35:17.310 --> 35:18.190
Why are you panicking?

35:18.790 --> 35:19.750
I've been running

35:19.910 --> 35:21.270
this Fujin Hall for countless years.

35:21.430 --> 35:23.190
How dare you ruffians run wild here?

35:23.990 --> 35:26.310
Today, I'm gonna wreck
this place of yours.

35:38.670 --> 35:39.110
Jinzhao.

35:41.310 --> 35:41.590
Qi!

35:42.670 --> 35:43.110
Jinzhao.

35:44.110 --> 35:44.710
Jinzhao.

35:46.550 --> 35:47.150
Miss Yue.

35:57.030 --> 35:57.950
What have you done to Qi?

35:58.230 --> 35:59.590
She...

35:59.870 --> 36:01.070
I...

36:08.750 --> 36:09.550
They have merged.

36:10.670 --> 36:11.550
They have merged.

36:11.710 --> 36:13.990
Only Lord Ming can merge with soul fish.

36:14.670 --> 36:15.710
Lord Ming.

36:16.710 --> 36:18.950
Lord Ming has appeared.

36:21.830 --> 36:24.310
- May Lord Ming bless us.
- May Lord Ming bless us.

36:26.710 --> 36:27.270
Lord Ming,

36:27.550 --> 36:29.990
you see us in a perilous situation,

36:30.150 --> 36:31.910
so you came out to guide us?

36:33.230 --> 36:34.990
No, I am not Lord Ming.

36:35.350 --> 36:36.470
I am not.

36:37.150 --> 36:38.830
Jinzhao, think of a solution!

36:39.230 --> 36:39.590
Qi.

37:10.230 --> 37:10.830
Jinzhao.

37:13.590 --> 37:14.150
Jinzhao.

37:17.270 --> 37:17.790
Jinzhao.

37:20.230 --> 37:20.830
Jinzhao.

37:30.310 --> 37:31.750
Jinzhao.

37:42.750 --> 37:43.350
Qi.

37:43.990 --> 37:44.590
Qi,

37:45.710 --> 37:46.830
come back.

37:47.190 --> 37:47.870
Come back to me.

37:47.870 --> 37:48.350
Qi.

37:48.350 --> 37:49.070
Who are you?

37:49.190 --> 37:50.030
Don't listen to her.

37:50.590 --> 37:51.950
Qi, don't listen to her.

37:51.950 --> 37:52.750
Jinzhao.

37:52.750 --> 37:53.910
Don't listen to her.

37:53.910 --> 37:54.870
Jinzhao abandoned you.

37:55.190 --> 37:55.590
No!

37:55.590 --> 37:57.030
Jinzhao has abandoned you.

37:57.510 --> 37:58.230
Who are you?

37:58.230 --> 37:59.150
Jinzhao abandoned you.

37:59.150 --> 37:59.830
Don't listen to her.

38:00.950 --> 38:02.190
I won't deceive you.

38:02.670 --> 38:03.750
Come back to me.

38:04.310 --> 38:05.510
Qi.

38:05.950 --> 38:06.430
Jinzhao abandoned you.

38:06.430 --> 38:06.910
Qi.

38:07.710 --> 38:09.150
Jinzhao abandoned you.

38:44.840 --> 38:48.360
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

38:49.860 --> 38:53.160
♪Burns what once was♪

38:53.930 --> 38:56.770
♪The name is forgotten♪

39:00.870 --> 39:04.680
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

39:05.900 --> 39:08.800
♪Only through the eyes♪

39:09.640 --> 39:13.190
♪Who can see them clearly♪

39:14.820 --> 39:21.480
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

39:22.700 --> 39:29.540
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

39:30.880 --> 39:38.820
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

39:38.820 --> 39:45.800
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

40:02.820 --> 40:06.820
♪The seemingly random paths♪

40:07.880 --> 40:11.360
♪The burning traces♪

40:11.880 --> 40:16.160
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

40:18.760 --> 40:23.200
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

40:23.910 --> 40:27.240
♪Are all carefully♪

40:27.850 --> 40:31.910
♪Arranged by me♪

40:32.870 --> 40:40.230
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

40:40.800 --> 40:47.810
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

40:47.810 --> 40:56.800
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

40:56.800 --> 41:04.070
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

41:04.840 --> 41:12.260
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

41:12.840 --> 41:20.230
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

41:20.900 --> 41:28.420
♪I'm madly in love with you
and do everything for you♪

41:28.960 --> 41:38.500
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
